OL,3,GNEWSAMan who sexually abused girls
OL,4,Ajailed for 14 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 14 years
OL,7,Fafter he was found guilty of
OL,8,F"disgusting" sex offences against two
OL,9,Fgirls aged 11 and 13.
OL,11,FMartin Davies, 44, of Bodmin Road in
OL,12,FHull, was sentenced at Hull Crown Court
OL,13,Fon Friday for four counts of rape of a
OL,14,Fchild and one count of inciting a child
OL,15,Fto engage in sexual activity.
OL,17,FDet Sgt Brydie Parker-Wood, of
OL,18,FHumberside Police, praised the "immense
OL,19,Fbravery and strength" of the women who
OL,20,Ftestified against Davies.
